        {
            "character": "Joan",
            "joanSpeakerSprite": "JoanUpset",
            "dialogue":"*Seriously... Think before you speak!"
        },
        {
            "character": "Joan",
            "joanSpeakerSprite": "JoanUpset",
            "dialogue": "*Idiot. Idiot, idiot, idiot."
        },
        {
            "character": "Joan",
            "joanSpeakerSprite": "JoanUpset",
            "dialogue": "Sorry... I wasn't thinking straight. You know I have a frail ego, Serena."
        },
        {
            "character": "Joan",
            "joanSpeakerSprite": "JoanUpset",
            "dialogue": "You know how badly I wanted that recognition for us, for Sonatine. How badly, I wanted us to be something..."
        },
        {
            "character": "Serena",
            "serenaSpeakerSprite": "SerenaUpset",
            "dialogue": "No. I don't know."
        },
        {
            "character": "Serena",
            "serenaSpeakerSprite": "SerenaUpset",
            "dialogue": "All I knew was how badly you wanted that attention."
        },
        {
            "character": "Serena",
            "serenaSpeakerSprite": "SerenaUpset",
            "dialogue": "That fame."
        },
        {
            "character": "Serena",
            "serenaSpeakerSprite": "SerenaUpset",
            "dialogue": "All for yourself."
        },
        {
            "character": "Serena",
            "serenaSpeakerSprite": "SerenaUpset",
            "dialogue": "Don't blame this on just your ego."
        },
        {
            "character": "Joan",
            "joanSpeakerSprite": "JoanUpset",
            "dialogue": "That's not true... I..."
        },
        {
            "character": "Joan",
            "joanSpeakerSprite": "JoanUpset",
            "dialogue": "Serena...you..."
        },
        {
            "character": "Serena",
            "serenaSpeakerSprite": "SerenaUpset",
            "dialogue": "Cats got your tongue? Or did you just realize everything I said was the truth?"
        },
        {
            "character": "",
            "joanSpeakerSprite": "Transparent",
            "dialogue": "(Joan tries her voice again but was swiftly interrupted by the announcer...)"
        },
        {
            "character": "",
            "joanSpeakerSprite": "Transparent",
            "dialogue": "Alright everyone! Who's ready for another round of Revolution Summer?"
